Error [E0127]: `+` is not available between `Usd` and `Eur`
  --> tests/ui/unit_family_mix.jet:9:14
    |
  9 |     total :: price + other
    |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `#Numeric` distinct types only support arithmetic between the same type
 Fix: Both sides must be `Usd`
